2026-06-25 19:36:35,369 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: Our company, Faber IA, offers an AI assistance solution that can provide support in drafting clinical and administrative content through template-guided drafting. This capability can help generate discharge summaries, medical reports, medical correspondence, and other documents, which aligns with the requirement for assistance in drafting clinical and administrative content.

For medical coding (PMSI/ICD-10) and activity reporting (T2A), our structured extraction capability can assist in extracting relevant information from clinical notes to support coding tasks. This feature is designed to aid professionals in accurately coding patient data, which is essential for activity reporting and reimbursement purposes.

To facilitate collaboration and continuity of care between professionals and services, our solution provides dossier-context continuity features. This allows for structured handover summaries that enable another professional or a colleague resuming a shift to efficiently take over an in-progress dossier with full context. Additionally, our action and verification suggestions can help professionals by recommending next steps based on the dossier context and applicable rules.

