Our iterative methodology involves corpus selection and curation with the client's experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop to ensure that our solution meets the required standards for quality, relevance, and compliance. This methodological approach ensures that our AI assistance solution is tailored to the specific needs of the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval while adhering to regulatory requirements and ensuring data sovereignty and security.

In summary, Faber IA's AI capabilities can meet the functional requirements by providing drafting assistance, supporting medical coding, facilitating continuity of care, and ensuring explainability and compliance. However, we must work closely with the client to tailor our solution to their specific needs and operational requirements.
